Cell["\<\
Follows BandDataWithWeight and replaces Map over samples with ParallelMap.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->141576978,ExpressionUUID->"de63ed61-ed0b-f14f-8fe3-8cb924817b7e"],

Cell["\<\
\"StateFunction\" defaults to Total[Abs[#]^4]& and accepts an anonymous \
function or a nonempty list of anonymous functions.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->136374295,ExpressionUUID->"861c549f-1fe1-0c49-bb5f-8932b4100a1e"],

Cell["\<\
For one state function the output is grouped by sample; for multiple \
functions the outer index selects the state function.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->878936666,ExpressionUUID->"9a39c0f6-e259-2246-8a4f-5d3192a582ee"],

Cell["\<\
The implementation uses the Arnoldi eigensolver and allows Eigensystem \
options. Load the package and model definitions on subkernels before use.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1649356864,ExpressionUUID->"2906cc5a-e0c7-ef41-ae57-d3218170f7f6"]
}, Closed]],

